# Working build output - npm run dev and npm run build:fast write here.
# dist/ is the deliverable and is written by `npm run build` alone.
.tmp/

# dist/ is NOT ignored: it is the deliverable and is tracked in git by default,
# so `git status` shows when the deliverable moved. It has exactly one writer,
# `npm run build`; every working build goes to .tmp/ above.
